# A beat repeat through the UI (the FX menu, the BEAT FX bank, RPT 1/8 on G#3 = key 3), recorded: tools outside the suite read the wav
# (the segments of an eighth should repeat sample for sample). Then the roll (bank 1, G#4 = key 15), recorded too.
seed 0
wait 4000
tap FX
wait 100
spin SELECT 1
wait 100
expect fxbank 1
wav rpt8.wav
wait 500
key 3 down
wait 2500
key 3 up
wait 500
wavstop
spin SELECT -1
wait 100
expect fxbank 0
wav roll.wav
wait 500
key 15 down
wait 4000
key 15 up
wait 500
wavstop
